  "title": "Nagging Spicy Indian Chicken Curry",
  "description": "A bitter, molten, show-off Indian dish featuring pineapple chunks, katsuramuki-cut, flexitarian-friendly. Best served in a mason-jar, garnished with fresh cilantro.",
