  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for an additional 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the sliced green chili and cook for 2 minutes, stirring frequently.",
    "Add the katsuramuki-cut chicken breast and cook until browned, about 5-6 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped pineapple, turmeric, coriander, cumin, red chili powder, and garam masala. Stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 5-7 minutes, allowing the flavors to meld.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Serve hot in a mason-jar, garnished with chopped cilantro.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
  ],
